===Seven Island (Town)===
The town of [[Seven Island (town)|Seven Island]] holds little more than a Pokémon Center and Poké Mart. On the main bridge, an Ace Trainer offers to teach the move {{m|Swords Dance}} to a compatible Pokémon.

